<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>MandaNica</title>
<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f5f6fa;
  color: #222;
}
header {
  background: #087c48;
  color: white;
  padding: 25px 18px;
}
header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 30px; }
header p { margin-bottom: 0; }
main { padding: 20px; }
h2 { color: #087c48; }
.categories {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 14px;
}
.category {
  background: white;
  padding: 22px 10px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: bold;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px #ddd;
}
.category span {
  display: block;
  font-size: 32px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  color: #666;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>🇳🇮 MandaNica</h1>
<p>Pedí fácil, recibí rápido.</p>
</header>
<main>
<h2>¿Qué necesitás hoy?</h2>
<div class="categories">
<div class="category"><span>🍕</span>Restaurantes</div>
<div class="category"><span>🛒</span>Supermercados</div>
<div class="category"><span>💊</span>Farmacias</div>
<div class="category"><span>🏪</span>Tiendas</div>
<div class="category"><span>📦</span>Mandados</div>
<div class="category"><span>🏍️</span>Transporte</div>
</div>
</main>
<footer>
MandaNica 🇳🇮<br>
Conectando Nicaragua.
</footer>
</body>
</html>